    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38266" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pressim</span></b> , adv.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>with pressing</i>, <i>by pressing to one's
			self</i> (post-class.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">me pressim deosculato,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">App. M. 2, p. 121, 32</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">linteolo pressim agglutinato,</span>”
				i. e. <i>closely pressed</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 2</span></i>
			, p. 128, 23.</div>
